OL,3,GNEWSAFrom TV weight loss star to
OL,4,Aobesity campaigner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who shared her battle to lose
OL,7,Fweight through a television documentary
OL,8,Fhas become an advocate for better
OL,9,Funderstanding and treatment of obesity.
OL,11,FSarah Le Brocq grew up in Jersey and
OL,12,Fsaid she spent many of her teenage
OL,13,Fyears feeling different to her
OL,14,Fclassmates because of her body shape.
OL,16,FShe said she tried extreme diets and
OL,17,Flater spent years in a cycle of losing
OL,18,Fand regaining weight.
